**`GetUserCountry` can throw on invariant/neutral cultures.**

`new RegionInfo(CultureInfo.CurrentCulture.Name)` throws `ArgumentException` when the culture is invariant or neutral (e.g., `"en"` instead of `"en-US"`). Consider wrapping with try-catch or using a fallback.


<details>
<summary>Proposed defensive fix</summary>

```diff
